All AI artifacts in this directory are:

• regime‑declared
• lineage‑tracked
• retrieval‑bounded
• substrate‑agnostic
• non‑privileged

Models are components.
Behavior is instrumented.
Memory is retrieval scope.

This mirrors our LDS `.lineage` file exactly in spirit:
- no claims
- no promises
- no marketing
- just constraints

Anyone who opens it knows immediately what kind of system this is.
